# Files in this repo that must NOT be uploaded as public site assets.
#
# Cloudflare uploads the repo root as static assets. Without this list, .git/
# is served publicly — /.git/config and /.git/index were both reachable, which
# is the classic exposed-repository misconfiguration that lets tooling
# reconstruct the whole repo. Nothing secret is in there (the repo is public),
# but it should not be served, and it would become a real leak the moment this
# repo goes private.

.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.assetsignore
wrangler.jsonc
README.md
